Comment: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Truly, truly,
Comment: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Comment: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eleventh Episode\NThe Spirit of Sleep\NSleeping Spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.41,0:02:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.10,0:02:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you sneaking around?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is a day where it's okay to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.06,0:03:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I'm flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you must not get carried away just because you are away from your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.62,0:03:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't forgotten your promise to your mother, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.55,0:03:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep track of time at the mountain lodge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.74,0:03:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.51,0:03:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I get into fights easily, I must practice not getting angry during this one-week break!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.79,0:03:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.34,0:03:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm going off to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.58,0:03:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.61,0:03:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.70,0:03:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Garigori, where has the Prince gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What? It's just Dr. Uranari!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not time yet, I tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Time doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s a Prince, a young Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prince—er, His Highness—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,is playing on the hill, but... the time... I mean, the schedule must be kept!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.71,0:04:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful scenery!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.03,0:04:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.72,0:04:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the King's chair, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's the King's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's about to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.51,0:04:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, please return to the mountain lodge immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.98,0:04:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right in the middle of playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.91,0:04:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous, go on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.17,0:04:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s the point of wearing a thing like this!?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The King is ill, so you must deliver the welcoming address in his stead...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.60,0:04:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.54,0:04:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,His Highness Plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.82,0:04:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.79,0:04:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, Duralumin's kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.51,0:04:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, that little pest...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If Lord Duralumin hears that, it'll be a disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.09,0:04:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, did it really take him 8 years to finally graduate from kindergarten?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:05:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It took him 8 years to graduate from kindergarten?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.81,0:05:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Plastic, it doesn't hurt, it doesn't hurt. There, you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.93,0:05:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Plastic. Give a proper greeting just like we practiced.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.37,0:05:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Show them your best side so you don't lose to the likes of Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, you did make him practice, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.39,0:05:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Flawlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, I would appreciate it if you offered your greeting according to protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that, never mind that. Plastic, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.95,0:05:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, th-thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey now, Plastic, give your greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of practice was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, even if you say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.37,0:06:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's skip the greetings and go play.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget Duralumin! Plastic, let's go play!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.23,0:06:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When dining, do this, then that, and then—do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink with your spoon without making a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And then do this, and it goes like this, like this, like this, like this, like this, like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief, what a dimwit. Not worth teaching at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.80,0:06:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Straighten up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you little brat...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you bite my nose...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.75,0:07:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, what were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.98,0:07:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing really, I was just astonished by how quick a learner Prince Plastic is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.67,0:07:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so? Well then, shall we go to dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A toast to celebrate Prince Plastic's graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.71,0:07:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, as if I'd ever let Sapphire sit on that throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire must be a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.18,0:07:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,By law, a woman cannot take the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Sapphire is taken care of, the throne will belong to Plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.09,0:07:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, Dad is the King's only brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.11,0:07:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You are more than qualified. Let people laugh if they want—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.57,0:08:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I will definitely make sure Plastic sits on that throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.91,0:08:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.36,0:08:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going too, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Plastic, wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.35,0:08:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic! Come on, let's play, Plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.74,0:08:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So you like pictures, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.80,0:08:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this is just a picture, see? You can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.54,0:08:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to eat dat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.01,0:08:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is called a winter strawberry—a strawberry picked in winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But like I said, this is just a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.48,0:08:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to eat dat! I want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.91,0:08:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to eat something you can't have?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What a handful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.28,0:08:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I already said I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.91,0:08:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's asking for the impossible, Plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.14,0:08:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's summer right now. Winter strawberries can only be picked in winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.73,0:09:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We have them, we have them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.30,0:09:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There are winter strawberries!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.59,0:09:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Are you saying they can be found even in summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.36,0:09:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep in these woods, there's a field where winter strawberries grow even in summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go pick them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.41,0:09:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've sent the soldiers to fetch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Grand Duke Duralumin...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, I've made sure everyone thinks that the selfish person
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.59,0:09:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,demanding winter strawberries in the middle of the night is Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of noisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The prize money is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.66,0:10:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's making a racket in the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.44,0:10:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.53,0:10:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you surprised, you foolish human alliance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.80,0:11:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think that will work against the Sandman, the Spirit of Sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit of Sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.10,0:11:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit of Sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.58,0:11:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone staying up late at night is my enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that, you went and trashed the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of punishment should I give you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.14,0:11:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Endo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.26,0:11:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.35,0:11:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Endo, hand me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.82,0:11:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Anger potion, crying potion, laughing potion, sleeping potion... Ah, here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.03,0:11:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.77,0:11:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, take your punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.87,0:11:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an angel, so potions don't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine then, you guys can just go ahead and catch a cold like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Serve you right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who on earth brought you guys out here in the middle of the night!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.07,0:12:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Prince Sapphire. Late at night, he suddenly said he wanted to eat winter strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.01,0:12:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.18,0:12:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That fool of a prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.64,0:12:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Endo what kind of punishment should we give?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.19,0:12:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.52,0:12:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, Plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.33,0:12:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more patience. Come on, sit on the throne. Let Papa take a look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.49,0:12:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, what an infuriating child!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When I tell you to sit, you sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Papa swears to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will make you King, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.92,0:12:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I will sit you in that seat and place a crown upon your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.95,0:12:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you're a bit lacking, I have the power!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.79,0:13:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go home early... right on time...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.54,0:13:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You selfish idiot prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sandman has come to punish you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.94,0:13:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.68,0:13:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's sleeping soundly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.15,0:13:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A Sleep Fairy can't go attacking someone who's already asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.31,0:13:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Sleep Fairy, Lord Sandman
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.81,0:13:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it so you can never sleep again for the rest of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.42,0:13:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleep Fairy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.78,0:13:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.05,0:13:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you wanted winter strawberries, the forest is a complete mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.16,0:13:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.88,0:13:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:13:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want any winter strawberries!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.34,0:13:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.92,0:14:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who wanted them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.69,0:14:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to play dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.19,0:14:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... the one who wanted winter strawberries was Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.92,0:14:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The prince isn't that stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.84,0:14:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say unnecessary things!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.24,0:14:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, where is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do something terrible to Plastic, I won't forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.85,0:14:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.19,0:14:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Wind Fairy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.47,0:14:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As if anyone could match Lord Sandman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tobi-de yo! Hi no sei yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no... didn't I promise not to get angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.39,0:15:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Endo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.18,0:15:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.58,0:15:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to bully someone that young?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.28,0:15:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of bullying them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.02,0:15:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This kid tried to hit me out of nowhere! When I dodged, he started throwing a fit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.82,0:15:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy, Endo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.24,0:15:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it so you can never sleep again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.93,0:15:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, are you gonna go after someone dressed so nicely?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll let it slide!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.18,0:15:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Endo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.65,0:15:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to eat winter strawberries...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.26,0:15:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You selfish blockhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:16:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of your selfishness, my forest is a complete mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.72,0:16:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.55,0:16:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it so you can never sleep again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.35,0:16:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic... what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, did the winter strawberries arrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.06,0:16:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong with Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange? Wasn't he already strange to begin with?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.49,0:16:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean he’s really become strange now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.81,0:16:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief... stupidity can only be cured by death!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.17,0:16:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now, Plastic, close your eyes. Gently, close your eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting sleepy, so very sleepy. It's sleepy-time! Night-night time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.08,0:17:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only are you an idiot, you’re a total blowhard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my Plastic...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.24,0:17:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.68,0:17:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin, I might be able to cure him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.78,0:17:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.31,0:17:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.99,0:17:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to ask the Spirit of Sleep about Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.62,0:17:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do if the same thing happens to you that happened to Plastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.23,0:17:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.66,0:17:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, don't you feel sorry for Plastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.29,0:17:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic is your enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.59,0:17:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.89,0:17:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That hateful son of Duralumin! He is an unforgivable enemy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.35,0:17:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to usurp your throne! We have no reason to help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.15,0:17:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandman!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.29,0:17:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandman!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.48,0:17:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandman! Are you looking for me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:17:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandman!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.85,0:18:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.02,0:18:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.84,0:18:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.39,0:18:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What, did you come to get revenge for earlier this evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.76,0:18:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.55,0:18:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's wrong, Sandman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that, pitch black, isn't it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.61,0:18:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell what's going on when it's bright out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.16,0:18:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.08,0:18:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.94,0:18:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you must fix Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.56,0:18:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll apologize for ruining the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.17,0:18:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're groveling because you're scared, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.88,0:18:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.62,0:18:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.11,0:18:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! I'm not supposed to fight, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Endo, do that thing to the coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.40,0:18:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.51,0:19:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell asleep... wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.78,0:19:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.30,0:19:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.98,0:19:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.46,0:19:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaddya want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.08,0:19:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Insolent, you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I insolent?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not insolent!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.76,0:19:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You should just get mad if they do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This prank is going way too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.00,0:19:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's fairy medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Weakling!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And to think that's supposed to be a prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the potion to make them angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.71,0:19:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.82,0:19:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, try this next!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.24,0:19:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sandman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.31,0:19:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandman's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.82,0:20:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.89,0:20:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just like a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.76,0:20:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.74,0:20:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandman!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.36,0:20:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, now I'm mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.43,0:20:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, what's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.02,0:20:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd all your energy go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.10,0:20:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Endo, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've made me angry-!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.64,0:20:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I'd ever tell you, even if you try to intimidate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.90,0:20:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me how to fix Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.53,0:20:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He can just stay like that for the rest of his life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.22,0:20:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If I tell you, will you do as I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.13,0:20:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then bow down on your hands and knees in front of me and beg!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.60,0:20:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow down and beg?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.30,0:20:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.07,0:20:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta get on your hands and knees and beg!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.52,0:20:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.33,0:21:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do it, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.04,0:21:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A prince getting down on his hands and knees to beg!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.06,0:21:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is priceless!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.15,0:21:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A prince just got down on his hands and knees and begged me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.20,0:21:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Endo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.47,0:21:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And to think he's supposed to be a prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.36,0:21:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cowardly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.74,0:21:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in a different mood, aren't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.33,0:21:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Going out of your way for someone else's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.74,0:21:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandman!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.91,0:21:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.87,0:21:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that jar for?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you try anything funny...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.22,0:22:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is medicine to cure Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.59,0:22:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic is cured, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.18,0:22:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.61,0:22:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.43,0:22:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to thank you enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.34,0:22:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.07,0:22:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do it for the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.58,0:22:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.18,0:22:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think of this? This is a\Nmedicine that turns things rock-solid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.35,0:22:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.80,0:22:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to make him suffer again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.37,0:22:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We pour this on the prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.64,0:22:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,On the prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.94,0:22:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.66,0:22:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.26,0:22:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shedding tears just because he saved us isn't like you at all, Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.60,0:22:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be cold and calculating here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.82,0:22:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless we get rid of the prince, Prince Plastic can't take the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.89,0:22:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.03,0:22:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave everything to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.61,0:23:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had a dream that you saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.83,0:23:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't dream such silly dreams and get a good night's sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.82,0:23:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.52,0:23:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, I wonder if any kids are staying up late?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.91,0:23:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrol time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.88,0:23:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleep well...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.56,0:23:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.41,0:23:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay like that for a while!
